**/*.md
!DEPLOY.md
# Tracked data/ files ship with the build context by construction — never
# re-add a per-subdir allowlist here (it silently strips new subdirs; broke
# the 2026-08-27 deploy when data/research/ appeared). Exclude only heavy
# local artifacts:
data/geo/*.mmdb
# openclaw/ ships complete inside the image: the prebuild hook packages it
# into public/ as the skill tarball, so nothing under it may be context-
# stripped (the **/*.md rule above was silently gutting SKILL.md/RANKING.md
# from the served tarball — caught live 2026-08-03).
!openclaw/**
# ...except a developer's local `npm i --prefix openclaw`, which is built for
# whatever machine they are on and is re-installed on the user's own machine
# by install.sh. The top-level `node_modules` rule above does not reach it.
openclaw/node_modules
